nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af145VTg3-nJbKiUN5dKXsku83J1RmM8_hAEj1U3WQk8Vg&oe=69F0A7D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FFcP90Xkv8oQ7kNvwHWVu39&_nc_oc=Ado9_4acJbkBJ1RM5blhN9zdBGeYF5TpIncxEayY3Wg6GV-ENDdxHd-x1fCA5PlLMtU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0i2zIXKS53tGTSnhTDvVu0ENkFEYR-txbGL7rOvNVP9Q&oe=69F0AD15"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qcGtOqcLDO0Q7kNvwFwpG9k&_nc_oc=Adq3nU_3yqC0ODxXp0lskWX5vDeDQnJ--m2f8Rah7hoyq3sDpKM3vVaB9HglMb9JdmU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2TZWpU8E_hW51q1hlBpC26xkswfsIFy7V_Dc0P5p8BaQ&oe=69F0C0C2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kRAzR1W2G_gQ7kNvwETldIw&_nc_oc=Adqqx5r9Y6Am-6cI2-hOfGidNK3Jw38cIVGvUu40TfkcA18CMQP5tH5RxO_82Bmtu_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af19b61lzltm-w5JqDdN7efC3tO_0GAUAMdr7_Wz1xiCxw&oe=69F0A744"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SKtrCOavub4Q7kNvwHKgdMA&_nc_oc=AdoE3p-mplXjPC-vO-PN18B7MeQpLjUuOTeb0d2zI5mwK-Q2PC_P4nDs5onlZqn9NCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0xO2mP2A4MUP2KEJWZK2BqWi17f7Rd5MqTFJyrMN6nXw&oe=69F09FA2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "874968081049627", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_874968084382960_490444167917392231_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qI0lrBEKTwQQ7kNvwE14Akl&_nc_oc=AdoZPudykq-eW10Ig09W6jAaz_kOyyiEFIw3U1j-L39zCcnmKn2KgyqfiEA2EOu7mEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af01j5ZukWj_doWxJyRdj_-Fo7uL8MCuKK